<!-- 5 Solution overview -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="kicker">Solution</div>
  <h1>RedactAgent: detect, decide, redact, prove &mdash; all on-prem</h1>
  <p class="lead">A hybrid pipeline: deterministic rules for precision, a local LLM for context, a local VLM for what is not text,
    and purpose-based policies that decide what to do with each finding.</p>
  <div class="flow" style="margin:10px 0 26px">
    <div class="step"><b>1 &middot; Ingest</b><span>PDF, scan or phone photo; pages rendered at 150 dpi; SHA-256 logged.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>2 &middot; Read</b><span>PP-OCR (ONNX / OpenVINO) with per-character boxes, EN + 中文.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>3 &middot; Detect</b><span><span class="badge b-rule">RULE</span> <span class="badge b-llm">LLM</span> <span class="badge b-vlm">VLM</span> layers, merged and cross-checked.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>4 &middot; Decide</b><span>Purpose policy: redact, pseudonymise, keep year only, or keep.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>5 &middot; Review</b><span>Human approves or rejects each box in the browser.</span></div><div class="arr">&rarr;</div>
    <div class="step"><b>6 &middot; Export &amp; prove</b><span>Pixel-burned PDF, de-identified text, hash-chained audit.</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid3">
    <div class="card"><h3>Finds what regex cannot</h3><p>Names in narratives, the role of each person (patient vs. physician vs. witness),
      quasi-identifiers, handwritten fields, signatures, ID photos and red seals.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Redacts for a purpose</h3><p>The same page becomes an IRB extract with consistent pseudonyms, a court exhibit that keeps
      the parties, or a public release that keeps only officials. Policies are editable YAML.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Built to be trusted</h3><p>No hidden text layer to copy-paste, reviewer decisions recorded, every export hashed into a
      tamper-evident chain. Runs fully offline.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span>RedactAgent &middot; ASUS UGen AI League 2026</span><span>5</span></div>
</section>

